    "text": "The German print of the first McDonald's set, the 12 holo Pokémon Black & White cards North America got in June 2011. In Germany and Austria they came in Happy Meals from 9 March to 5 April 2012: three cards in each, beside one of four figures, Zoroark, Pikachu, Reshiram or Zekrom."
  },
